autoagy
Codex-style auto mode for Google Antigravity.

This project contains material adapted from OpenAI Codex
(https://github.com/openai/codex, tag rust-v0.154.0), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

- plugin/prompts/policy_template.md and plugin/prompts/policy.md are adapted
  from codex-rs/core/assets/guardian/policy_template.md and policy.md.
- The reviewer output contract, the rejection and timeout messages, the
  transcript budgets and selection rules, the rejection circuit breaker, and
  the dangerous-command and known-safe-command heuristics follow
  codex-rs/core/src/guardian/, codex-rs/guardian-context/ and
  codex-rs/shell-command/src/command_safety/.

Changes: the prompts were rewritten for Google Antigravity's tools, terminal
sandbox and permission model, for a reviewer without tools, and extended with
rules about agent-oversight tampering and routine development actions.
